      "l10n": {
        "en": {
          "series": "Playing Tag at Neverland",
          "summary": "Shun, the instructor at Plum Blossom Garden who was exhausted and overworked, drinks an elixir made by Saya and becomes a small 9 year old child. At first, she only planned on having a bit of fun, but child Shun's troublemaking quickly grows out of hand. Sensei and the students work together to stop Shun and bring her back to her old self...",
