      },
      "summary": "히나에게 휴가를 주고자 바다를 찾은 선생님과 선도부! 하지만 계속해서 트러블이 덮쳐오는데! 과연 선생님과 선도부는 히나에게 제대로 된 여름 휴가를 선물할 수 있을까?",
      "l10n": {
        "en": {
          "series": "Head Prefect Hina's Summer Break!",
          "summary": "「As the executive officer of the Disciplinary Committee, I hereby issue an emergency special order! We must at any cost give our overworked president a break!!」 Ako, after deciding that Hina needed a break from being overworked, brings Sensei and the Disciplinary Committee to the beach, supposedly in the most peaceful area in Gehenna. However for some reason, trouble keep occurring one after another, and the Disciplinary Committee members are in panic... What will happen to President Hina's summer vacation now!?",
