        "fit": "cover",
      },
      "summary": "키보토스에도 발렌타인 데이가 찾아왔다. 발렌타인 데이 축제 현장의 치안을 지키기 위해, 선생님은 발키리 경찰학교의 학생들과 함께 순찰을 돌기 시작하는데⋯⋯. 과연 아무 일 없이 무사히 넘어갈 수 있을까?",
      "l10n": {
        "en": {
          "series": "Schale's Happy ♥ Valentine Patrol",
          "summary": "Valentine's Day season has arrived in Kivotos! At the event site, which is more crowded than usual, Sensei is taken out on a patrol by Kirino and Fubuki. At the same time, Sena from the Emergency Medical Department and Chihiro from Veritas are also on guard duty. Still, the day is not going to end easily...! The girls' feelings, and their day of competition, begins!",
