          "summary": "By chance, the Countermeasure Council obtained a ticket to use a resort. They then visited the island to enjoy their vacation, but what awaited them was a vast deserted island and an abandoned resort! Just what had happened!? The countermeasure council will now start the plan to restore the resort! However, it was not going to be a simple task and proceed smoothly... For some reason, the Helmet gang attacked, and even one of the seven prisoners, Wakamo!? What will the countermeasure council do now, and will they be able to restore the resort and enjoy their vacation in peace!?",
