          "summary": "As the end of the year approaches, the Gourmet Research Society were enjoying a meal at the Suzume Pavilion, a private restaurant with a pleasant atmosphere. While the Gourmet Research Society was happy to have found a famous restaurant that they were satisfied with, Suzume Pavilion was said to close its doors at the end of the year... The members of the Gourmet Research Society, who were sad to hear about the closure of Suzume Pavilion, embark on a rebuilding plan and drag Fuuka of the School Lunch Club along in order to keep the restaurant open. The curtain rises, and so begins the slapstick restaurant rebuilding drama involving the unpredictable Gourmet Research Society and Fuuka!",
