          "series": "Alabaster Calling Card: Mansion Masquerade and the Essence of Beauty",
          "summary": "Momoi was at the game center, and a client had mistaken Momoi for Neru from C&C and was asked to \"clean up\". The rest of the Game Development Club later learn about the request and decided to take on the request. They then changed into maid outfits and pretend to be C&C. Will they be able to complete the request...? The curtain rises on the slapstick mayhem surrounding the phantom thief and the aesthetic artwork!",
