          "summary": "Genryumon, the student council of the Shanhaijing, which values history and tradition, and Black Tortoise Promenade, which believes in evolution. The two opposing forces existed in a precarious balance of power as the two major factions in Shanhaijing. In the midst of all this, the Black Tortoise Promenade were accused of smuggling out a certain item. Rumi had to ask for SCHALE's help in order to clear their name of suspicion. Will they be able to overcome this crisis and find the real culprit...?",
